      "body": "In the vagrant 21.04 box running bpftrace_test\r\n\r\n without libbpf:\r\n\r\n3.28user 0.91system 0:04.76elapsed 88%CPU (0avgtext+0avgdata 91660maxresident)k\r\n69000inputs+0outputs (428major+7890minor)pagefaults 0swaps\r\n\r\nWith libbpf, before it goes oom\r\n\r\n21.60user 10.38system 0:32.42elapsed 98%CPU (0avgtext+0avgdata 1761664maxresident)k\r\n64inputs+0outputs (6major+2820965minor)pagefaults 0swaps\r\n\r\n",
