    {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/3604",
      "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace",
      "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/3604/labels{/name}",
      "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/3604/comments",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/3604/events",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/3604",
      "id": 2691320124,
      "node_id": "PR_kwDOCMCh9c6DD65n",
      "number": 3604,
      "title": "dibuilder: Use string_view for constexpr string",
      "user": {
        "login": "danobi",
        "id": 824615,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDYxNQ==",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/824615?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/danobi",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi/gists{/gist_id}",
        "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
        "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi/subscriptions",
        "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi/orgs",
        "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi/repos",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi/events{/privacy}",
        "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/danobi/received_events",
        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 0,
      "created_at": "2024-11-25T16:15:18Z",
      "updated_at": "2024-11-26T07:55:28Z",
      "closed_at": "2024-11-26T07:55:28Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/3604",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/3604",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/3604.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/3604.patch",
        "merged_at": "2024-11-26T07:55:28Z"
      },
      "body": "std::string is not very const. The build fails with the following on clang17:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsrc/ast/dibuilderbpf.cpp:216:34: error: constexpr variable cannot have non-literal type 'const std::string' (aka 'const basic_string<char>')\r\n  216 |     static constexpr std::string struct_prefix = \"struct \";\r\n      |                                  ^\r\nlibgcc/include/c++/trunk/bits/basic_string.h:85:11: note: 'basic_string<char>' is not literal because it is not an aggregate and has no constexpr constructors other than copy or move constructors\r\n   85 |     class basic_string\r\n      |           ^\r\nsrc/ast/dibuilderbpf.cpp:217:34: error: constexpr variable cannot have non-literal type 'const std::string' (aka 'const basic_string<char>')\r\n  217 |     static constexpr std::string union_prefix = \"union \";\r\n      |                                  ^\r\nlibgcc/include/c++/trunk/bits/basic_string.h:85:11: note: 'basic_string<char>' is not literal because it is not an aggregate and has no constexpr constructors other than copy or move constructors\r\n   85 |     class basic_string\r\n      |           ^\r\n2 errors generated.\r\n```\r\n\r\nFix by using string_view which accomplishes the same thing.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease provide a description of your change below this comment.\r\n\r\nThen please complete the checklist.\r\n\r\nUseful contribution guidelines and tips are in docs/developers.md.\r\n\r\nWarning: please make sure that you have implemented and tested your\r\n         change against the latest version of bpftrace (unless opening a\r\n         PR for a release branch).\r\n-->\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] Language changes are updated in `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc`\r\n- [ ] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [ ] The new behaviour is covered by tests\r\n",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/3604/reactions",
        "total_count": 1,
        "+1": 1,
        "-1": 0,
        "laugh": 0,
