      "body": "I've been trying to build bpftrace  0.13.0 ageinst llvm 13.0.0-rc3\r\nAfter patchinch main CMakeLists.txt with patch below\r\n```patch\r\n--- a/CMakeLists.txt~   2021-07-01 08:18:41.000000000 +0100\r\n+++ b/CMakeLists.txt    2021-09-16 20:11:06.952800030 +0100\r\n@@ -159,7 +159,7 @@\r\n     find_package(LLVM REQUIRED)\r\n   endif()\r\n\r\n-  if((${LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR} VERSION_LESS 6) OR (${LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR} VERSION_GREATER 12))\r\n+  if((${LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR} VERSION_LESS 6) OR (${LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR} VERSION_GREATER 13))\r\n     message(SEND_ERROR \"Unsupported LLVM version found: ${LLVM_INCLUDE_DIRS}\")\r\n     message(SEND_ERROR \"Specify an LLVM major version using LLVM_REQUESTED_VERSION=<major version>\")\r\n   endif()\r\n```\r\nbuild fails with:\r\n```console\r\n[tkloczko@barrel x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu]$ make -k\r\n/usr/bin/cmake -S/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0 -B/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu --check-build-system CMakeFiles/Makefile.cmake 0\r\n/usr/bin/cmake -E cmake_progress_start /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu/CMakeFiles /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu//CMakeFiles/progress.marks\r\nmake  -f CMakeFiles/Makefile2 all\r\nmake[1]: Entering directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\nmake  -f CMakeFiles/parser.dir/build.make CMakeFiles/parser.dir/depend\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\ncd /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu && /usr/bin/cmake -E cmake_depends \"Unix Makefiles\" /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0 /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0 /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu/CMakeFiles/parser.dir/DependInfo.cmake --color=\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\nmake  -f CMakeFiles/parser.dir/build.make CMakeFiles/parser.dir/build\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\nmake[2]: Nothing to be done for 'CMakeFiles/parser.dir/build'.\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\n[  3%] Built target parser\r\nmake  -f src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/build.make src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/depend\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\ncd /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu && /usr/bin/cmake -E cmake_depends \"Unix Makefiles\" /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0 /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/src/arch /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu/src/arch /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu/src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/DependInfo.cmake --color=\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\nmake  -f src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/build.make src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/build\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\nmake[2]: Nothing to be done for 'src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/build'.\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\n[  4%] Built target arch\r\nmake  -f src/ast/CMakeFiles/ast.dir/build.make src/ast/CMakeFiles/ast.dir/depend\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu'\r\ncd /home/tkloczko/rpmbuild/BUILD/bpftrace-0.13.0/x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu && /usr/bin/cmake -E 