      "body": "I'm building bpftrace on openSUSE Tumbleweed. The following error occurs. I tried to look at the internals and this seems to be related to `libiberty` static library and its disassembler. I wonder why we even need that when the BPF build process otherwise relies on LLVM but that's another story. There seems to be a type mismatch at least in my installation as libiberty doesn't seem to have a stable API and that's probably why it's not distributed as a shared lib.\r\n\r\n```\r\n[  3%] Built target parser\r\n[  4%] Built target arch\r\n[  9%] Built target ast\r\nScanning dependencies of target resources\r\n[ 10%] Building CXX object resources/CMakeFiles/resources.dir/headers.cpp.o\r\n[ 10%] Linking CXX static library libresources.a\r\n[ 10%] Built target resources\r\n[ 10%] Building CXX object src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/bfd-disasm.cpp.o\r\n/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/bfd-disasm.cpp: In function ‘bpftrace::AlignState bpftrace::is_aligned_buf(void*, uint64_t, uint64_t)’:\r\n/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/bfd-disasm.cpp:88:30: error: cannot convert ‘bfd*’ to ‘bfd_architecture’\r\n   88 |   disassemble = disassembler(bfdf);\r\n      |                              ^~~~\r\n      |                              |\r\n      |                              bfd*\r\nIn file included from /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/bfd-disasm.cpp:12:\r\n/usr/include/dis-asm.h:327:63: note:   initializing argument 1 of ‘int (* disassembler(bfd_architecture, bfd_boolean, long unsigned int, bfd*))(bfd_vma, disassemble_info*)’\r\n  327 | extern disassembler_ftype disassembler (enum bfd_architecture arc,\r\n      |                                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~\r\nmake[2]: *** [src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/build.make:323: src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/bfd-disasm.cpp.o] Error 1\r\nmake[1]: *** [CMakeFiles/Makefile2:1200: src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/all] Error 2\r\nmake: *** [Makefile:141: all] Error 2\r\n```\r\n\r\nSome package versions:\r\n\r\n```\r\ngcc-9-1.6.x86_64\r\nbinutils-devel-2.33.1-2.1.x86_64 (includes /usr/lib64/libiberty.a)\r\nllvm9-9.0.1-3.1.x86_64\r\nclang9-9.0.1-3.1.x86_64\r\n```\r\n\r\nVerbose build:\r\n\r\n```\r\n/usr/bin/cmake -S/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace -B/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace --check-build-system CMakeFiles/Makefile.cmake 0\r\n/usr/bin/cmake -E cmake_progress_start /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/CMakeFiles /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/CMakeFiles/progress.marks\r\nmake -f CMakeFiles/Makefile2 all\r\nmake[1]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake -f CMakeFiles/parser.dir/build.make CMakeFiles/parser.dir/depend\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\ncd /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace && /usr/bin/cmake -E cmake_depends \"Unix Makefiles\" /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/CMakeFiles/parser.dir/DependInfo.cmake --color=\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake -f CMakeFiles/parser.dir/build.make CMakeFiles/parser.dir/build\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake[2]: Nothing to be done for 'CMakeFiles/parser.dir/build'.\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\n[  3%] Built target parser\r\nmake -f src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/build.make src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/depend\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\ncd /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace && /usr/bin/cmake -E cmake_depends \"Unix Makefiles\" /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/arch /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/arch /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/DependInfo.cmake --color=\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake -f src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/build.make src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/build\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake[2]: Nothing to be done for 'src/arch/CMakeFiles/arch.dir/build'.\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\n[  4%] Built target arch\r\nmake -f src/ast/CMakeFiles/ast.dir/build.make src/ast/CMakeFiles/ast.dir/depend\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\ncd /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace && /usr/bin/cmake -E cmake_depends \"Unix Makefiles\" /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/ast /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/ast /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/ast/CMakeFiles/ast.dir/DependInfo.cmake --color=\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake -f src/ast/CMakeFiles/ast.dir/build.make src/ast/CMakeFiles/ast.dir/build\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake[2]: Nothing to be done for 'src/ast/CMakeFiles/ast.dir/build'.\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\n[  9%] Built target ast\r\nmake -f resources/CMakeFiles/resources.dir/build.make resources/CMakeFiles/resources.dir/depend\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\ncd /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace && /usr/bin/cmake -E cmake_depends \"Unix Makefiles\" /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/resources /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/resources /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/resources/CMakeFiles/resources.dir/DependInfo.cmake --color=\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake -f resources/CMakeFiles/resources.dir/build.make resources/CMakeFiles/resources.dir/build\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake[2]: Nothing to be done for 'resources/CMakeFiles/resources.dir/build'.\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\n[ 10%] Built target resources\r\nmake -f src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/build.make src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/depend\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\ncd /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace && /usr/bin/cmake -E cmake_depends \"Unix Makefiles\" /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/DependInfo.cmake --color=\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake -f src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/build.make src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/build\r\nmake[2]: Entering directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\n[ 10%] Building CXX object src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/bfd-disasm.cpp.o\r\ncd /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src && /usr/lib64/ccache/c++  -DBPFTRACE_VERSION=\\\"v0.9.2-271-gb6de\\\" -DHAVE_BCC_CREATE_MAP -DHAVE_BCC_ELF_FOREACH_SYM -DHAVE_BCC_PROG_LOAD -DHAVE_BFD_DISASM -DHAVE_NAME_TO_HANDLE_AT=1 -I/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src -I/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/ast -I/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace -I/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/resources/../src -isystem /usr/include/bcc  -D_GNU_SOURCE -D__STDC_CONSTANT_MACROS -D__STDC_FORMAT_MACROS -D__STDC_LIMIT_MACROS -Wno-format-security -Wall -Wextra -Wundef -Wpointer-arith -Wcast-align -Wwrite-strings -Wcast-qual -Wswitch-default -Wunreachable-code -Wdisabled-optimization -std=c++14 -o CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/bfd-disasm.cpp.o -c /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/bfd-disasm.cpp\r\n/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/bfd-disasm.cpp: In function ‘bpftrace::AlignState bpftrace::is_aligned_buf(void*, uint64_t, uint64_t)’:\r\n/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/bfd-disasm.cpp:88:30: error: cannot convert ‘bfd*’ to ‘bfd_architecture’\r\n   88 |   disassemble = disassembler(bfdf);\r\n      |                              ^~~~\r\n      |                              |\r\n      |                              bfd*\r\nIn file included from /home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace/src/bfd-disasm.cpp:12:\r\n/usr/include/dis-asm.h:327:63: note:   initializing argument 1 of ‘int (* disassembler(bfd_architecture, bfd_boolean, long unsigned int, bfd*))(bfd_vma, disassemble_info*)’\r\n  327 | extern disassembler_ftype disassembler (enum bfd_architecture arc,\r\n      |                                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~\r\nmake[2]: *** [src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/build.make:323: src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/bfd-disasm.cpp.o] Error 1\r\nmake[2]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake[1]: *** [CMakeFiles/Makefile2:1200: src/CMakeFiles/bpftrace.dir/all] Error 2\r\nmake[1]: Leaving directory '/home/pavlix/src/oss/bpftrace'\r\nmake: *** [Makefile:141: all] Error 2\r\n```",
